  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRS Gaza Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza is having overwhelming humanitarian needs since October 2023 in all sectors. A multisector response of Caritas partner CRS is addressing as many needs as possible given the limited supplies flowing into Gaza as long as there is no cease-fire.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide and, if possible, scale up humanitarian assistance to meet needs of affected people in Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
